<title>USA: Koo Koo Roo Hamburger Hamlet buy okayed.</title>
<headline>Koo Koo Roo Hamburger Hamlet buy okayed.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koo Koo Roo and Hamburger Hamlet Restaurants Inc said Friday a bankruptcy court approved the purchase of 14 Hamburger Hamlet locations for approximately $11.45 million, consisting of $9.70 million in cash and 150,000 shares of restricted common stock.</p>
<p>The purchase agreement is expected to close the first week in May at which time Koo Koo Roo will assume full management of operations.</p>
</text>
